OL,4,CSearch and rescue teams race against   
OL,5,Ctime to find survivors after Nigeria   
OL,6,Cboat tragedy                           
OL,7,GNigerian search and rescue teams are   
OL,8,Gracing against time to find survivors  
OL,9,Gafter a boat carrying mourners         
OL,10,Gtravelling to a funeral capsized on    
OL,11,GFriday.                                
OL,13,FTwenty-nine bodies have been recovered 
OL,14,Fand 50 people rescued so far, a        
OL,15,Fspokesperson for the National          
OL,16,FEmergency Management Agency (Nema)     
OL,17,Ftold the BBC.                          
OL,19,FThe government has responded by        
OL,20,Fordering stricter enforcement of       
OL,21,Fsafety standards on the country's      
OL,22,Finland waterways.                      
